# ===================================================
# 🔐 LOCAL ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES TEMPLATE (.env.example)
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your actual keys!
# DO NOT COMMIT YOUR REAL .env FILE TO GITHUB!
# ===================================================

# Database Credentials
DB_USERNAME=root
DB_PASSWORD=password

# Stripe Payment Keys (Get from https://dashboard.stripe.com/apikeys)
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_test_your_stripe_secret_key_here
STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=whsec_your_stripe_webhook_secret_here

# Keycloak / OAuth2 Security
KEYCLOAK_CLIENT_SECRET=your_keycloak_client_secret_here
